  "label": "Mermaid as Symbol of Objectification",
  "description": "The mermaid, often depicted in fantasy and erotic contexts, is used here as a visual metaphor for a woman being objectified or reduced to a fantasy figure. Her crossed arms and defiant posture contrast with the objectifying nature of the request, highlighting resistance to being controlled or used in a role-playing scenario.",
